{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/36f07bb71c101cb425a77df2f12a381f.avif?t=1762827675\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Idol cultivation process \uff1aunspoken rules \u2605\u30df&quot; is a short adult idol Raising simulation game developed by nikukyu and published by 072 Project.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work for an idol agency that is on the verge of closing down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a producer, your goal is to train the last remaining idol, &quot;Yumesaki&quot; into a &quot;perfect idol&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/862bcd90fb139a262bfdb68f54382f7b.avif?t=1762827675\" width=600 height=100 /></span>You finally joined the dream Management Company, 0721 Project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But on your first day at work, you were informed about 0721's impending bankruptcy!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the struggling 0721, you take on the role of the last idol, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yumesaki Humino,&quot; as her manager.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2499670/extras/35bc786190896b70179049812337bf40.avif?t=1762827675\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dancing,&quot; &quot;singing,&quot; &quot;skills,&quot; &quot;charisma&quot;...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in four different courses and strive towards the &quot;N Stage&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa